sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant APIGW as API Gateway
    participant FhirMW as withLambdaHandler
    participant Handler as user-service getUser
    participant UserSvc as UserService
    participant OrgRepo as OrganizationRepository
    participant FhirCore as FHIR Core Library

    Client->>APIGW: GET /fhir/Patient/{userId}
    APIGW->>FhirMW: Invoke Lambda
    FhirMW->>FhirMW: Build request context\nparse auth\nvalidate request
    FhirMW->>Handler: Call business handler
    Handler->>UserSvc: getUser(userId, organizationId)
    UserSvc-->>Handler: domain user
    Handler->>OrgRepo: getOrganizationFromDB(organizationId)
    OrgRepo-->>Handler: org metadata
    Handler-->>FhirMW: canonical model
    FhirMW->>FhirCore: canonical -> Patient
    FhirCore-->>FhirMW: Patient resource or Bundle
    FhirMW-->>APIGW: application/fhir+json
    APIGW-->>Client: FHIR JSON
